Copyright: Ansible Project contributors
License: GPL-3.0+
Comment: The kubernetes.core Ansible collection, downloaded from Ansible Galaxy
 at build time and unpacked into the package. Debian's own ansible package
 ships an older release of this collection that does not support Helm 4, so the
 appliance carries its own copy; see vendor/README.md. The collection is
 distributed as source, and is aggregated with rather than linked into the rest
 of the package. Its tree also contains PSF-license.txt.

